Main flow:
1. POST create → 201, id
2. POST tare 8000 @T0 → 201
3. POST gross 12000 @T0+20m → 201; GET detail → previewNetKg 4000
4. clock.set(T0+25m); POST reweigh 12100 → 201; GET detail → dispute.status OPEN
5. GET detail → disputeId; POST /api/disputes/{id}/adjudicate {adoptedSource REWEIGH, reweighId} → 201
